<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's Forward says resolved claims.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's Forward says resolved claims.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forward Corporation Ltd said on Monday claims it instituted against a number of parties have been resolved to the satisfaction of the board.</p>
<p>In a notice to shareholders, the company said the claims which were instituted against Jeffrey Michael Liebesman, Neville Cohen, Confor Investments One (Pty) Ltd and other parties had been resolved.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27-11 482 1003</p>
</text>
